  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix Chardonnay wine, club soda, orange-flavored liqueur, sugar, grapes, kiwis, and pear in a large pitcher. Stir until sugar is dissolved. Pour wine mixture into wine glasses filled with ice, making sure each glass has some fruit. Garnish with mint sprigs.",
